<DialogueTree xmlns:xsi="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema-instance" xsi:noNamespaceSchemaLocation="https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Outer-Wilds-New-Horizons/new-horizons/main/NewHorizons/Schemas/dialogue_schema.xsd">
	<NameField>Bruce</NameField>

	<DialogueNode>
		<Name>START</Name>
		<EntryCondition>DEFAULT</EntryCondition>
		
		<Dialogue>
			<Page>Hello, traveller. My name is Bruce. I am a scientist</Page>
			<Page>I am in charge of the Sun Stabilisation Project. Without me, we would have no shot at saving the planet!</Page>
			<Page>I sure hope nothing bad happens to me.</Page>
		</Dialogue>
		
		<RevealFacts>
			<FactID>LEESPORK_JAM6_BRUCE_X1</FactID>
		</RevealFacts>
		
		<DialogueOptionsList>
			<DialogueOption>
				<Text>How is the sun stabilisation device going?</Text>
				<DialogueTarget>DEVICE_STATUS</DialogueTarget>
			</DialogueOption>
			<DialogueOption>
				<Text>Do you just go around telling everybody that you are a scientist?</Text>
				<DialogueTarget>YES</DialogueTarget>
			</DialogueOption>
			<ReuseDialogueOptionsListFrom>HUB</ReuseDialogueOptionsListFrom>
			
		</DialogueOptionsList>
	</DialogueNode>

	<DialogueNode>
		<Name>HUB</Name>
		<Dialogue>
			<Page>This dialogue will never appear so no one will know that I'm gay.</Page>
		</Dialogue>
		
		<DialogueOptionsList>
			<DialogueOption>
				<Text>Hey Bruce, could you do me a favo<!--u-->r and stand 3 steps to the left?</Text>
				<DialogueTarget>STEP</DialogueTarget>
				<RequiredLogCondition>LEESPORK_JAM6_BRUCE_X_DIED</RequiredLogCondition>
				<ConditionToSet>LEESPORK_JAM6_BRUCE_SAVED</ConditionToSet>
				<CancelledCondition>LEESPORK_JAM6_BRUCE_SAVED</CancelledCondition>
			</DialogueOption>
			<!--
			<DialogueOption>
				<Text>So, how's the husband?</Text>
				<DialogueTarget>HUSBAND</DialogueTarget>
			</DialogueOption>
			-->
			<DialogueOption>
				<Text>See you later.</Text>
				<DialogueTarget>BYE</DialogueTarget>
			</DialogueOption>
		</DialogueOptionsList>
	</DialogueNode>

	<DialogueNode>
		<Name>DEVICE_STATUS</Name>
		<Dialogue>
			<Page>I'm still working on it! Currently, it is only <![CDATA[<color=#28B2FF>one quarter</color>]]> as powerful as it would need to be to save the sun...</Page>
			<Page>But, even with the deadline fast approaching, I have to stay optimistic and keep working on it! Even if I fear I might need a 3-day <![CDATA[<color=#28B2FF>time extension</color>]]> to finish it...</Page> <!-- lol -->
			<Page>Once I have gotten it four times as powerful as it currently is, we can send it up into a low solar orbit to stabilise the sun, and save the planet!</Page>
		</Dialogue>
		
		<RevealFacts>
			<FactID>LEESPORK_JAM6_SUN_STATION_X1</FactID>
			<FactID>LEESPORK_JAM6_SUN_STATION_X2</FactID>
		</RevealFacts>

		<DialogueOptionsList>
			<ReuseDialogueOptionsListFrom>HUB</ReuseDialogueOptionsListFrom>
		</DialogueOptionsList>
	</DialogueNode>

	<DialogueNode>
		<Name>STEP</Name>
		<Dialogue>
			<Page>Weird request, but sure!</Page>
		</Dialogue>
	</DialogueNode>

	<DialogueNode>
		<Name>YES</Name>
		<Dialogue>
			<Page>Yes.</Page>
		</Dialogue>
		
		<DialogueOptionsList>
			<DialogueOption>
				<Text>How is the sun stabilisation device going?</Text>
				<DialogueTarget>DEVICE_STATUS</DialogueTarget>
			</DialogueOption>
			<ReuseDialogueOptionsListFrom>HUB</ReuseDialogueOptionsListFrom>
		</DialogueOptionsList>
	</DialogueNode>

	<DialogueNode>
		<Name>BYE</Name>
		<Randomize />
		<Dialogue><Page>Goodbye, traveller.</Page></Dialogue>
		<!-- <Dialogue><Page>No, I will see you *earlier*!</Page></Dialogue> -->
	</DialogueNode>

</DialogueTree>
